@startuml
title OID4VP 제출

autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor User as user
participant "Wallet" as wallet

box "Verifier" #EEF7FF
participant "Verifier Service" as sp
participant "OID4VP SDK" as sdk
participant "Formatter SDK\n(SD-JWT VC / mDoc)" as formatter
end box

sp -> sdk: POST /oid4vp/initiate\n(dcql_query 또는 scope,\nresponse_mode, use_request_uri)
sdk -> sdk: DCQL 검증\nscope 매핑 및 client_metadata 병합
sdk -> sdk: state, nonce, request_id,\ntransaction_id 저장

alt By Value
    sdk --> sp: authorization_request_uri\n(openid4vp://?...dcql_query...)
else By Reference
    sdk --> sp: authorization_request_uri\n(openid4vp://?request_uri=...)
else DC API
    sdk --> sp: dc_api_request
end

sp -> user: QR, 링크, 브라우저 API 등으로 요청 표시
user -> wallet: Authorization Request 전달

opt By Reference
    wallet -> sdk: GET /oid4vp/request/{request_id}
    sdk -> sdk: request_id 세션 조회\n만료/1회 사용 검증
    sdk -> sdk: Authorization Request Object 서명\nJWS 또는 x5c header
    sdk --> wallet: application/oauth-authz-req+jwt
end

wallet -> wallet: DCQL 조건에 맞는 Credential 선택
wallet -> wallet: VP Token 생성\nHolder Binding(aud, nonce)

alt direct_post
    wallet -> sdk: POST /oid4vp/response\nvp_token, state
else query / fragment
    wallet -> sdk: GET 또는 callback\nvp_token, state
else dc_api
    wallet -> sp: navigator.credentials.get() 응답
    sp -> sdk: POST /oid4vp/dc-api/response\nvp_token, transaction_id
end

sdk -> sdk: state로 세션 조회
sdk -> sdk: vp_token 파싱\nCredential Query ID별 분리
sdk -> sdk: Issuer/Holder 식별자 추출 및 공개키 조회\n또는 x5c 신뢰 체인 검증 준비
sdk -> formatter: 서명, Holder Binding,\nnonce/aud, DCQL 충족 검증
formatter --> sdk: 검증 결과

alt 검증 성공
    sdk --> sp: 200 OK\nverification_result valid
    sp --> user: 서비스 제공
else 검증 실패 또는 사용자 취소
    sdk --> sp: error, error_description,\nverification_result
    sp --> user: 오류 안내
end

@enduml
